summary:
## Cognizant boundaries

Never claim:

- an exact infrastructure-cost reduction;
- a certification, duration, platform-specific metric, or new business outcome that is not supported;
- later employer metrics, products, or responsibilities as Cognizant work;
- an unconfirmed team size, business domain, client, dashboard count, uptime, or error rate;
- a title other than Program Analyst.

